        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "a20f4f88-236f-3571-9fb9-5f18f4c066c0",
                "word": "substitut",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "14ef60f7-148c-4232-80c9-08a867c5a488",
                        "entry_id": "a20f4f88-236f-3571-9fb9-5f18f4c066c0",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "substituts"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "0ebff5eb-5f27-45d5-9505-d4f81cfd0334",
                        "entry_id": "a20f4f88-236f-3571-9fb9-5f18f4c066c0",
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "substitute"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4b591f53-e558-3c37-8a27-9a5eee905d44",
                        "entry_id": "a20f4f88-236f-3571-9fb9-5f18f4c066c0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Celui qui tient la place d’un autre, qui exerce les fonctions d’un autre, en cas d’absence ou d’empêchement légitime."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8dddad78-9caf-40c5-9595-8ec4f701f7ca",
                                "sense_id": "4b591f53-e558-3c37-8a27-9a5eee905d44",
                                "text": "Il l’a nommé son substitut."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "76dea5bf-4b7e-3127-a958-010ff441f764",
                        "entry_id": "a20f4f88-236f-3571-9fb9-5f18f4c066c0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Magistrat chargé de remplacer au parquet le procureur général, le procureur de la République."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "especially"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "20d7e4fd-531b-4f82-b465-acc2d100c17b",
                                "sense_id": "76dea5bf-4b7e-3127-a958-010ff441f764",
                                "text": "À dix heures, deux autos descendaient la pente légère qui aboutit au château. L’une, vénérable calèche, contenait le substitut du procureur et le juge d’instruction accompagné de son greffier."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "46ffc902-6f9f-31d0-9c42-33db1def4e3f",
                        "entry_id": "a20f4f88-236f-3571-9fb9-5f18f4c066c0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ce qui tient lieu d’autre chose, qui remplace."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3c68e9ab-6611-4e96-b9f6-23260f643af9",
                                "sense_id": "46ffc902-6f9f-31d0-9c42-33db1def4e3f",
                                "text": "— Kézaco, demandé-je, encore, car, si j'avais été bien élevée et si je connaissais à fond toutes les variétés de came consommée par les gens de ma génération, je ne savais pas que le haschich était devenu chez les ouvriers le substitut du coït du samedi soir […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0bd348a7-0770-4a0a-b404-5d91f6cf55c4",
                                "sense_id": "46ffc902-6f9f-31d0-9c42-33db1def4e3f",
                                "text": "Les opposants à cette mesure estiment au contraire que l’ivoire du mammouth de Sibérie peut sauver l’éléphant d’Afrique du braconnage, en lui servant de substitut."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "19962b39-ec3c-454c-84a4-7303acc9eb3b",
                                "sense_id": "46ffc902-6f9f-31d0-9c42-33db1def4e3f",
                                "text": "Certains mâchent du chewing-gum pour compenser le manque de nicotine, moi je lèche des sucettes pour compenser le manque de sérotonine. La sucette est un excellent substitut – sucetitut ? De la douceur à croquer pour combler le manque de douceur à tripoter."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8bb49068-a196-3cf7-8b75-63cce6bb89d3",
                        "entry_id": "a20f4f88-236f-3571-9fb9-5f18f4c066c0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Mère porteuse."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "especially"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "97fcce81-3709-4e48-8316-dad4050001e3",
                                "sense_id": "8bb49068-a196-3cf7-8b75-63cce6bb89d3",
                                "text": "Les partisans de la GPA non seulement occultent l'exploitation des mères, mais les effacent résolument : la mère porteuse devient un simple « substitut », une « tierce reproductrice », une « femme porteuse » ou une « porteuse gestationnelle ». Tout est mis en place pour éviter l'emploi du mot « mère » et évoquer le rapport biologique et social qui lie l'enfant à sa mère et ce, jusqu'à évacuer le nom de cette dernière sur les certificats de naissance."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "311e33d3-4fa3-380a-9c2c-485b2d0d2586",
                        "entry_id": "a20f4f88-236f-3571-9fb9-5f18f4c066c0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Signe avec lequel on peut faire diverses opérations intellectuelles sans avoir besoin de penser à la réalité signifiée."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "especially"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "00d30feb-0ba1-4a5a-8ee7-9ededbac9576",
                        "source_entry_id": "a20f4f88-236f-3571-9fb9-5f18f4c066c0",
                        "source_sense_description": "Celui qui tient la place d’un autre",
                        "target_lang_word": "substitute",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "substitute",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "298043c2-b849-32de-ada5-c9e6b5fd0a5d",
                                        "entry_id": "6254b6d9-8901-3805-b6c6-971f43517d94",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To use in place of something else, with the same function."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b0296dbd-c566-4d4e-83ac-e990a9ca0c89",
                                                "sense_id": "298043c2-b849-32de-ada5-c9e6b5fd0a5d",
                                                "text": "I had no shallots so I substituted onion."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "163f1c81-fd6e-3b5c-bdd9-412a541da3c9",
                                        "entry_id": "6254b6d9-8901-3805-b6c6-971f43517d94",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To use X in place of Y."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "408f12f9-da0f-4ae8-84df-1b43f8fc0369",
                                                "sense_id": "163f1c81-fd6e-3b5c-bdd9-412a541da3c9",
                                                "text": "I had to substitute new parts for the old ones."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3fa0b57b-c0ee-301f-a3d4-d464866ab8ba",
                                        "entry_id": "6254b6d9-8901-3805-b6c6-971f43517d94",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To use Y in place of X; to replace X with Y."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f1a2077-57b7-44b8-9eac-2a493958d7ec",
                                                "sense_id": "3fa0b57b-c0ee-301f-a3d4-d464866ab8ba",
                                                "text": "I had to substitute old parts with the new ones."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dfe67648-05ca-3ecd-a758-ef0d1b08be98",
                                        "entry_id": "6254b6d9-8901-3805-b6c6-971f43517d94",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To remove (a player) from the field of play and bring on another in his place."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3232c03f-0386-4b5b-9d12-cc9180255a63",
                                                "sense_id": "dfe67648-05ca-3ecd-a758-ef0d1b08be98",
                                                "text": "He was playing poorly and was substituted after twenty minutes"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44ed6f22-efe4-4225-ba0d-526c3cc2f015",
                                                "sense_id": "dfe67648-05ca-3ecd-a758-ef0d1b08be98",
                                                "text": "Mario Balotelli replaced Tevez but his contribution was so negligible that he suffered the indignity of being substituted himself as time ran out, a development that encapsulated a wretched 90 minutes for City and boss Roberto Mancini."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d09ed6dc-468f-3819-947a-62b845061f8c",
                                        "entry_id": "6254b6d9-8901-3805-b6c6-971f43517d94",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To serve as a replacement (for someone or something)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dbe7ebc2-4e55-4e7f-a513-e77eb0405324",
                                                "sense_id": "d09ed6dc-468f-3819-947a-62b845061f8c",
                                                "text": "Accumulation of wealth by this route may substitute for personal saving."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "substitute",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "887ff48c-8c17-3d8f-afe8-d86ffd680b33",
                                        "entry_id": "13f1509a-7830-36af-9c30-e9b988f5df89",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A replacement or stand-in for something that achieves a similar result or purpose."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7bbf6f68-321d-4659-b2c7-41354313ca09",
                                                "sense_id": "887ff48c-8c17-3d8f-afe8-d86ffd680b33",
                                                "text": "Ladies [in William Shakespeare's age], again, universally wore masks as the sole substitute known to our ancestors for the modern parasol; a fact, perhaps, not generally known."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "571caae1-258d-490e-89b3-0562ba786135",
                                                "sense_id": "887ff48c-8c17-3d8f-afe8-d86ffd680b33",
                                                "text": "Since you left me, if you see me with another girl / Seeming like I'm having fun / Although she may be cute, she's just a substitute / Because you're the permanent one"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ab25465e-a6ee-4e3e-9903-cddee0aa4243",
                                                "sense_id": "887ff48c-8c17-3d8f-afe8-d86ffd680b33",
                                                "text": "Here we go. AK-47. The very best there is. When you absolutely, positively got to kill every motherfucker in the room, accept no substitutes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9615f433-6662-3f0d-8c7a-0eb4d1968953",
                                        "entry_id": "13f1509a-7830-36af-9c30-e9b988f5df89",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A substitute teacher."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4046c72a-3a1c-3142-9243-c2d8c3b9b71d",
                                        "entry_id": "13f1509a-7830-36af-9c30-e9b988f5df89",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A player who is available to replace another if the need arises, and who may or may not actually do so."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d32439e-ec74-4fab-9f0b-a5bbf89c6950",
                                                "sense_id": "4046c72a-3a1c-3142-9243-c2d8c3b9b71d",
                                                "text": "Dean Whitehead opened the scoring shortly after the break with a low finish and substitute Peter Crouch sealed the win with a tap-in."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a37b8883-d79f-3d15-93b6-28b76ebf53f7",
                                        "entry_id": "13f1509a-7830-36af-9c30-e9b988f5df89",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who enlists for military service in the place of a conscript."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
